# shell: desktop
# prefs: factory
# TikuDiff from the Applications menu: blank until asked, then two files
# chosen in the shell's own panel, left and then right, and compared --
# the rows drawn by the application's process, the counts in its status.
wait 20
click 980 40
wait 4
menu-pick Applications
wait 4
expect-menu TikuDiff
menu-pick TikuDiff
wait 30
expect-title TikuDiff
note nothing compared: the window says nothing at all
shot /tmp/trk_diff_empty.png
key o ctrl
wait 30
note the shell's panel asks for the left file
expect-title Open
key Down
wait 4
key Return
wait 30
note and then, at once, for the right one
expect-title Open
key Down
wait 4
key Down
wait 4
key Return
wait 40
expect-no-title Open
expect-title TikuDiff - one.c : two.c
expect-narrate 2 lines removed, 4 added
expect-narrate Change 1 of 3
shot /tmp/trk_diff_files.png
note the next change, from the Go menu's shortcut
key ] ctrl
wait 8
expect-narrate Change 2 of 3
key w ctrl
wait 10
expect-no-title TikuDiff
